- Deleted four commented-out debug log blocks (`LogUtils.d/e`).

**`GsonUtils.java`**

- `getGson4LogUtils`: Replaced the check-then-put pattern with `ConcurrentHashMap.computeIfAbsent`, which atomically constructs-and-stores the `Gson` instance only once even under concurrent access.

